    "text": "thenorthernlight.com\nwebsite\nFerndale\nRoad work to close parts of I-5 from Blaine to Ferndale\nBy Julia Hawkins,\n5 hours agoThe Washington State Department of Transportation (WSDOT) has scheduled overnight lane and ramp closures for pavement repairs on I-5 southbound from Blaine to Ferndale. Sections of the shoulder will also be closed during day and night for guardrail repairs. The $7.6 million project was expected to begin July 16 and...",
